{
  "name": "dsh-workspace-recollection",
  "version": "2.17.0",
  "description": "给 DeepSeek Harness 的跨会话记忆：按工作区隔离、跨会话共享的长期记忆。默认只往 system prompt 里注入一行提示（告诉模型「你有其他会话的记忆」并指向 memory_index / memory_recall），并且带一道工具层守卫 —— 新会话的第一个探索型动作（pwsh / read / glob …）若还没查过记忆就先拦一次（只拦一次，不会卡死），目录、要点、原文全部走工具按需取；长文用段级引索定位到段、只取那一段，深层原文（当时的思考、命令、结论）留在本地向量库里按需取回。检索自带噪音过滤与时间通道（时间轴按首次安装检测到的时区显示），零联网（本地嵌入模型），不改动官方内核。另带一块自包含的记忆管理台（GET /api/session-memory/page，可在客户端全屏内嵌，也能用系统浏览器开成独立窗口）：按工作区浏览、新增、编辑、删除、置顶、锁定、改归属、重载数据、重建向量。工作区目录改名之后，按工作区身份指纹（git remote / 包名 / 文件名特征）自动认领旧记忆，不用手动搬。",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "memory",
    "long-term-memory",
    "cross-session",
    "semantic-search",
    "embeddings",
    "rag",
    "cordis"
  ],
  "homepage": "https://github.com/reaxlll/dsh-workspace-recollection#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/reaxlll/dsh-workspace-recollection.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/reaxlll/dsh-workspace-recollection/issues"
  },
  "author": "reaxlll",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets/icon.svg",
    "assets/console.html",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "node --test \"tests/**/*.test.mjs\""
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": ">=22.0.0",
    "typescript": ">=5.5.0"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.12.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@huggingface/transformers": "^4.3.0"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths": ">=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.3.0-0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.3.0-0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.1.7-rc.2": "incompatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible"
      }
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-modules"
      ]
    }
  }
}
